        "calls": 1,
        "text": "The shared rulebook for how alerts reach your devices has been expanded with detailed descriptions for both phone push notifications and the live connection used by desktop and browser apps. This is internal engineering work that defines the exact data and formats the system will use, but no part of it is active yet because the code that actually sends or receives these messages has not been updated. As a result, you will see no change in your daily use of the assistant; this step simply prepares the foundation for future notification features.",
